# Dev Container: .devcontainer/devcontainer-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored — the resolved
# Feature versions and digests are tracked, so the same commit yields the same environment until
# the lock is refreshed on purpose (ADR-0003, AGENTS.md, section 6).

# Environment files — never tracked, in any directory (they may hold secrets);
# a secrets-free .env.example stays tracked
.env*
!.env.example

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Per-user agent settings
.claude/settings.local.json
